Read the root AGENTS.md before planning, editing, or running commands. AGENTS.md is the single source of truth for BlinkQuest's requirements, documentation paths, architecture, design system, task tracking, validation, and Git safety. Do not duplicate its rules here. Use pnpm only, preserve existing work, and do not claim unverified behavior. No new test files during the current MVP completion pass. Do not commit or push unless explicitly requested. If a request limits scope to agent instruction files, edit only those files.
